msgstr "Clasificar"

#: templates/classify.html:439
msgid "All Classified!"
msgstr "¡Todo clasificado!"

#: templates/classify.html:440
msgid ""
"No more unclassified faces. However, the model rejected some faces you "
"might want to review."
msgstr ""
"No hay más rostros sin clasificar. Sin embargo, el modelo rechazó algunos"
" rostros que quizás quieras revisar."

#: templates/classify.html:442
#, python-format
msgid "%(num)d image with model-rejected faces to review."
